  "notes": "Warm paper-like palette (cream #f3eee4 with dotted grid texture) instead of typical dark dev-tool look; serif Fraunces headings + Plex Sans/Mono give an editorial feel. The map clusters modules into hand-drawn-looking blobs per service (green Driver SMS worker, peach Donor web app, grey-blue Dispatch API) and folder sub-blobs; dashed lines show dependencies, solid amber lines show blast radius rings, black arrowed path with numbered circles shows the call trail. Issue numbers appear as small dark-outlined labels pinned to modules. Coverage is encoded as a 5-step diverging red→teal scale repeated as mini bars across panels. Volunteer-friendly copy ('Copy a question for Marco', 'Untouched for a long while'). Clicking a legend band shows a dark pill 'Highlighting Under 20% · 16 modules ×' at top of the map. Deselecting shows an empty state 'Nothing selected' with a 'Big and lightly tested' list (live only)."
